msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, can I stop you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, ¿puedo interrumpirte?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What is it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「I went out of my way to spend time＿with you, and yet all you have to ask is＿this stupid shit?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Me tomé la molestia de pasar tiempo＿contigo, ¿y lo único que preguntas＿es esta estúpida mierda?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I wouldn't call it stupid......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo no lo llamaría estúpido......」"

msgid "Taiga「Whatever. I'll assume this means the＿holes in your memory have been filled.＿See ya.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Como sea. Asumiré que esto significa＿que los huecos de tu memoria se＿llenaron. Nos vemos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What? You're not going home?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué? ¿No te vas a casa?」"

msgid "Taiga「I still have shopping to do. Great.＿Thanks to you, I've wasted a bunch of＿time.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Todavía tengo compras que hacer.＿Genial. Por tu culpa, perdí＿un montón de tiempo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Even when she's not insulting me,＿she's so harsh......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Incluso cuando no me está insultando,＿es tan dura......）」"
